        "Can't write next to the game ({0}). To keep your data there, move the game's folder "
        "somewhere you can write, such as Documents.")
MT_TEXT(data_help_translocated,
        "macOS runs MapleThief from a temporary read-only copy (App Translocation). To keep your "
        "data next to the game, see the README's \"macOS: first start\".")
MT_TEXT(data_help_no_base, "The game's own folder is unknown, so your data is in your user "
